<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Refripar 9-mo net 32.019 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Refripar 9-mo net 32.019 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian home appliance manufacturer Refripar sent the following statement to the stock exchanges on its January-to-September results.</p>
<p>				  Jan-Sept 1996</p>
<p>    Net profit		  32.019 million</p>
<p>    Net revenues	     597.218 million</p>
<p>NOTE: No comparative figures were provided. All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 55-11-2485412</p>
